Device Preview for ClawMuse

Android gRPC transport and coordinate transforms are adapted from Cindy official plugins,
cindy-simulator/node/android/grpc.cjs and node/geometry.cjs,
commit 4223c43e440d2c695b6ad649b9a4d97b22a7cf4c.
Source: https://github.com/makecindy/cindy-official-plugins
Modifications: typed dependency-free protocol subset, bounded buffers, cancellation,
normalized coordinates and the ClawMuse RPC transport.

